%C A084073 a(14) > 9.9999*10^13. - _Jeff Sponaugle_, Oct 17 2026
%H A084073 <a href="/index/Ph#Pi314">Index entries for sequences related to the number Pi</a>
%e A084073 The repeated digits are 3, 3, 1, 6, 3, 4, 7, ..., i.e., at position a(1) = 1, there is one '3', starting at position a(2) = 25, there are two '3's, from position a(3) = 154 on, there are three '1's, etc.
